flowchart LR
    subgraph Authoritative[Authoritative within product workflow]
        Initial[Initial user narrative]
        Clarification[User clarification answer]
        Added[Added case information]
    end
    Raw[Raw Evidence Snapshot and SHA-256]
    subgraph Derived[Derived and non-authoritative]
        Assistant[Assistant messages]
        Ask[User ask interaction]
        RAG[MITRE and RAG context]
        Trace[AnalysisTrace]
        Report[Report]
        Preview[Document OCR preview]
    end
    Initial --> Raw
    Clarification --> Raw
    Added --> Raw
    Raw --> Trace
    RAG -. external context .-> Trace
    Trace --> Report
    Assistant -. excluded .-> Raw
    Ask -. excluded .-> Raw
    Preview -. not yet admitted .-> Raw

